## What originates from upstream

The Cordis runtime, the plugin/service architecture, and the majority of the
`packages/` tree originate from DeepSeek Harness.

The Cordis framework and its foundation libraries are source-vendored rather
than consumed from npm; exact upstream commits and local modifications are
recorded in [`vendor/README.md`](vendor/README.md).

## What JUDY adds

- `presets/` — industry agent presets and their plugins
- `deploy/` — Docker deployment
- `website/` — the JUDY site
- Product branding, theming, and default configuration

